+  required `1_{nonclean} >= 1-(b(P)-b(a))` holds because if `b(a)=b(P)` then
+  `e(a)>2^(b-1)` so that child is nonclean, and if `b(a)<=b(P)-1` the right side
+  is `<=0`. This is the already-recorded 16:15Z soundness direction; the open
